    "4. For each field: font = `${weight} ${size}px Sarabun`, fillStyle = color, textBaseline = 'alphabetic', textAlign = align; draw line i at y = baseline + i*lineHeight (x = x, x+width/2 or x+width by align). If the text is wider than width, wrap on spaces up to maxLines, then shrink size (keep baseline = y + round(1.08*size)) down to minSize.",
    "Labels, logo, NOW I KNOW ABP stamp, QR/barcode art and all static chrome are baked into the PNG: draw only the field values."
  ],
  "notes": "QR and barcode are decorative; the QR encodes the non-URL text 'TFT-ABP-SAMPLE / DECORATIVE ONLY'. Field boxes include headroom for Thai vowel/tone marks above and descenders below the baseline.",
